  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">\"A costume Hiyuki wore while filming a movie with Startorch Academy students.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">Her gaze has lost none of its resolve or compassion, nor her movements their grace. With blade and frost at her command, she remains every bit as dangerous.\"</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">Hiyuki's Deluxe Outfit \"Lune Noire\" will become available once Version 3.8 goes live. Get a sneak peek now!</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">✦How to Obtain✦</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Hiyuki's Deluxe Outfit \"Lune Noire\" will be made permanently available in the Store once Version 3.8 goes live.Purchase the Outfit during Version 3.8 at a discount, for 1980 Lunites only. After Version 3.8 ends, the Outfit costs 2480 Lunites.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1793808000000/2emgq3oj8q21gjyg2j-1793878574727.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1793808000000/v72mqpk7dlf3ljf8m3-1793878593341.gif\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1793808000000/q8yhn96hmyw4j0tt5i-1793878610280.gif\" width=\"800\" 